NOTE: This is a placeholder SAS file. Real SAS7BDAT files require SAS software to generate properly.
For R usage, install the 'haven' package which can read SAS files.

Sample medical data structure:
- patient_id: Patient identifier
- age: Patient age
- gender: M/F
- blood_pressure_sys: Systolic blood pressure
- blood_pressure_dia: Diastolic blood pressure  
- cholesterol: Total cholesterol level
- diabetes: 0/1 indicator
- bmi: Body mass index
- treatment_group: A/B/C
- outcome_score: Treatment outcome (0-100)